  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FN S&#xe4;ndebudet Jemen, Inkluderande dialog</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Special Envoy Yemen, Inclusive dialogue</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till FN:s s&#xe4;ndebuds kontor i Jemen f&#xf6;r att m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra f&#xf6;r FN:s s&#xe4;ndebud att uppfylla sitt mandat som fastst&#xe4;llt i FN:s s&#xe4;kerhetsr&#xe5;dsresolution 2216. St&#xf6;det syftar till att st&#xf6;dja FN&#xad;s&#xe4;ndebudets anstr&#xe4;ngningar att s&#xf6;ka en politisk l&#xf6;sning p&#xe5; konflikten i Jemen. Den planerade verksamheten syftar till att
st&#xe4;rka f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar f&#xf6;r en fredlig l&#xf6;sning p&#xe5; den p&#xe5;g&#xe5;ende konflikten, och d&#xe4;rmed m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra hantering av den allvarliga humanit&#xe4;ra situationen i landet. Sidas st&#xf6;d utg&#xe5;r till en nyligen etablerad fond som s&#xe4;tts upp i syfte att m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra f&#xf6;r FN:s s&#xe4;ndebud att resurss&#xe4;tta sitt kontor f&#xf6;r att uppfylla mandatet
i en tid av snabba f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar i den regionala spelplanen i Mellan&#xf6;stern med direkt och indirekt p&#xe5;verkan p&#xe5; situationen i Jemen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Office of the Special Envoy of the Secretary General for Yemen to enable the Special Envoy to fulfill its mandate as set out
in UN Security Council Resolution 2216. The support aims to support OSESGY&apos;s efforts to seek a political solution to the conflict in Yemen. The planned activities aim to strengthen the conditions for a peaceful solution to the ongoing conflict. Sida will support the newly established Trust Fund set up with the aim of enabling the Special Enyoy to resource the office to fulfill the mandate in a time of rapid changes and escalation in the Middle East, which directly and indirectly impact the situation in Yemen.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support to the Office of the Special Envoy of the Secretary-General for Yemen aims to support OSESGYs work to enable the resumption of a peaceful, inclusive and Yemeni-led political transition process. The objective is to secure a negotiated political settlement to end the conflict, reduce violence, and identify elements for a political transition in Yemen that will lead to a comprehensive peace agreement. OSESGY works to de-escalate the conflict at the local, national, and regional levels, for example, through consultative processes including women, civil society, and youth to strengthen capacities for peace building.</narrative>
  </description>
